        "problem": "If $\\,A=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 5-\\text{i} \\\\ \\text{i} & -3\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}1-2\\text{i} & 1+2\\text{i} \\\\ -1 & 2\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]\\,$, then $AB=$",
